    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d2ec765a91beebb3c9cbaf</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 31 Aug 2024 10:12:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，这是第二期「低保真」系列节目，是一期由于飞机延误而促成的的即兴对谈。本期内容发际于主播 Mulan 的九宫格朋友圈“秋乏”，我们聊了聊这 9 张图片背后的故事。内容录制于 2024 年 8 月，重庆武隆仙女山机场候机厅。</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>时间线</span></strong></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FraeWUH0wBY0_SCZA88maXN8FVf1.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 第一张照片，在大疆总部听 techno</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">02:25</a> 简体中文语境聊女性，难上加难</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">05:20</a> MUJI 是减法设计的代表作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="431">07:11</a> 建筑是野心的承载体吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a> 追求极致效率的拼多多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="649">10:49</a> 设计感 vs 设计</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 深圳大厂观光必打卡点推荐</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsBizv-BNgIZEmpUSNnTOJn6i6wP.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="798">13:18</a> 第二张照片，看孟京辉话剧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="815">13:35</a> 一段话剧传单上的晦涩文字</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="932">15:32</a> 《一个陌生女人的来信》是真实生活还是心理幻象？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1135">18:55</a> 疯批女人的魅力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1242">20:42</a> 演独角戏的黄湘丽</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqn81J0Hyb-2nDI6qfekntpYNxas.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1336">22:16</a> 第三张照片，看小孩子弹电子琴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1374">22:54</a> 弹电子琴和弹钢琴到底有什么区别</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljyTOU3xu3gKfhZjCZCEVc2Ov3d-.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1513">25:13</a> 第四张照片，川美看展看到记录改开时期深圳的照片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1588">26:28</a> 北野武式鸡血还能振奋到年轻人吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">30:30</a> 黑白照片是逼格捷径么</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmrHJskTUI_T72bb6BVeBfqA8frI.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1926">32:06</a> 第五张照片，一场完全反效率的蛇口饭局</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2162">36:02</a> Base成都的同事也很卷啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2236">37:16</a> 在深圳科技园追梦的年轻人依旧很多</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjPIZwS4Ujh9VUotdaOeQGEp3H7T.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2287">38:07</a> 第六张照片，徒完虎跳峡全靠一碟云南沾水回魂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2383">39:43</a> 减脂人福音，还得是云南沾水</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhik_gJvXTOKf7AqQmK2V-lMTN7v.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2428">40:28</a> 第七张照片，喝一口酒，蹲一个活儿</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr8GYwj72dIwdgWo9_Ao-YrS-NfT.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2494">41:34</a> 第八张照片，边喝酒边爬的山是座荒诞的山</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2638">43:58</a> 状态急救妙招</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtN42JQttmWDeOpllG2KND5uhUaW.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2761">46:01</a> 最后一张照片，孕晚期在 live 现场馋酒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2844">47:24</a> 刑星喊的“广州瓷”是什么意思</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3070">51:10</a> SYSTEM 现场惊现九龙湖大佬</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>片头 &amp; 片中 &amp; 片尾曲：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>「The Model」- Kraftwerk</span></p><span></span><p><span>「Work It（Soulwax Remix）」- Marie Davison&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>「讓我搭一班會爆炸的飛機」- MLA</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>主播：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>季洋 / 慕蓝</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltaV5ou-MrBG3Z241fDoBkh2UfWO.m4a" length="53470627" type="audio/mp4"/>
