  <item>
    <title>vol.006 - 春游后遗</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/664113c8af1e22bb15eaeb31</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">664113c8af1e22bb15eaeb31</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 12 May 2024 19:08:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>成都「春游音乐节」是我和赵老师非常喜爱的现场，同时也是我认为国内最值得前往的音乐节之一。今年赵老师第二次去春游，回来后的后遗症愈发明显，来听听他怎么说。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>时间线：</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="256">04:16</a> 春游音乐节，morning 早上好，曾经的三圣乡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 为什么每年都要去一次春游？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="667">11:07</a> 让打工人全方位打开感知，感受自然，感受春天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="802">13:22</a> 春游不是一个打算讨好所有人的音乐节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1093">18:13</a> 专业安心的露营区，舒适安逸的户外体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1485">24:45</a> 露营区门口的过载舞台，还原西南生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1570">26:10</a> 吃喝这一块子，西南必不可少的精酿和火锅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1670">27:50</a> 何师烧烤，主打留学生下飞机后的第一顿烧烤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1770">29:30</a> 春游的餐饮铺子是音乐节的一部份，完整了音乐节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2015">33:35</a> 报菜名：干杯烧鸟，烧楽肉铺，喜楽食堂，咖啡车，美式汉堡，贝果，冷吃兔，大凉山美食，肥龙牛杂，云贵川融合 bistro，迷你卤肉饭，Gelato</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2360">39:20</a> 本次现场令人难忘的瓦栎泰式按摩（Valley Massage）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2488">41:28</a> 装置艺术，气质绝佳的 JUJU</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2620">43:40</a> 暗藏玄机的演出阵容，春游舞台与维他命舞台的呼吸感，室内感的早上好舞台，艺术家孵化地的想像力舞台，融合川剧/戏剧/朗诵/脱口秀/workshop 的过载舞台，世界音乐的嬉春林</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3438">57:18</a> 春游舞台的演出动线，恰到好处的假假条</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3632">1:00:32</a> 台湾宝藏另类摇滚 THE WAiiT，第一次在海外演出的印尼国宝级 emo 乐队 eleventwelfth，春游的主人 Kawa 乐队和 Stolen 秘密行动，赵老师的最爱 NaraBara，爆火的 SHORTPARIS</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4017">1:06:57</a> 国内音乐节怪象和乱象讨论，卖票导向，收割导向。大家如何选择一个适合自己去的“音乐节”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4203">1:10:03</a> 主打靠明星卖票的仙人掌音乐节，都市生活消费的草莓音乐节，精品都市流行的泡泡岛音乐节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4625">1:17:05</a> 音乐节品牌靠音乐节本身赚钱靠谱吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4859">1:20:59</a> 春游，招待会，鸡飞，越位，别的，先找到自己需要的内核才能找到适合自己的音乐节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5383">1:29:43</a> “春游的后劲儿比迷笛大多了”</span></p><span></span><h2><span>片头 &amp; 片尾曲：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>「华尔兹」- 孤独的利里</span></p><span></span><p><span>「Cheap Artist」- THE WAiiT</span></p><span></span><h2><span>主播：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>季洋 / 赵老师</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvLvW3QlrQUlS_eVcNFowhgh3X3T.m4a" length="94205277" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:35:05</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkh9cgG35bxQlto7fGlQyGTsVqFF.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.005 - 2023 最令人思考，宝藏以及弛放音乐分享</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e495bb9bf20df4c8a1aeb2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e495bb9bf20df4c8a1aeb2</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 03 Mar 2024 15:22:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>录制于龙年除夕前一天，天气转凉。我和赵老师继续盘点年度专辑。这次是“年度令人思考专辑”、“年度宝藏专辑”和“年度器乐/轻音乐/沙发/弛放专辑”。录了比上次更久，希望让更多人听到这些音乐，enjoy！</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="128">02:08</a> 无争议的年度最令人思考的专辑：「</span><a href="https://www.books.com.tw/products/0020233354" data-url="https://www.books.com.tw/products/0020233354"><span>Young Fresh Chin II</span></a><span>」- 夏之禹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">03:40</a> 中文 Hip Hop 如何跟世界接轨？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="432">07:12</a> 不是有马思唯的榜单太多，而是国内的“马思唯”太少了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a> 聊回夏之禹，关于成都、说唱、明堂、新旧中西文化的结合</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1205">20:05</a>「一天」- 夏之禹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1550">25:50</a> 蛙池「郊游」竟然是赵老师年度最失望专辑？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1857">30:57</a>「秋分」- 蛙池</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2188">36:28</a> 一个向内走的，遵从自己的，反标签的蛙池</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2884">48:04</a> 虎啸春「铸铁旅人」是直给的严肃文学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3017">50:17</a>「还是没有改变」- 南青乐队</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3302">55:02</a> 塑料 bokai，时代精神，世纪大停电以及「滇东幻想症」- 本能实业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3909">01:05:09</a> 好听的 Po Puu Platter，海外生活背景下的中式爵士表达</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4269">01:11:09</a>「Cha Kee 茶记」- Po Puu Platter</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5136">01:25:36</a> 绝对宝藏！「文理叙术 The Contextual Order」来自常德一中的前卫摇滚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5187">01:26:27</a>「People's Plastic」- 柯曼离析 Caumann Riechy</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5955">01:39:15</a> 大杂烩榜单的代价，极致拉踩中的鬼否和大七</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5997">01:39:57</a> 喜欢 new age 和新古典乐的不要错过「栖居在溪源之上」- Cicada</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6070">01:41:10</a> 因为第一次宣布不再巡演而火的全能乐队“鲸鱼马戏团”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6163">01:42:43</a>「Days Gone」- Fayzz，赵老师的年度无定语最佳摇滚专辑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6200">01:43:20</a>「浪潮 Tide」- Fayzz</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6869">01:54:29</a> 很难不让人联想窦唯受没受窦靖童影响的「贤文冬至月会」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6933">01:55:33</a> 「童媛世界 - 选段 圣诞老人」- 窦唯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7410">02:03:30</a> 「Mystery Death」- Mong Tong</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7826">02:10:26</a> 2023听音乐的变化，时代变局和迷笛风暴眼中的大疆 Action3</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头 &amp; 片尾曲：</span></p><span></span><p><span>「华尔兹」- 孤独的利里</span></p><span></span><p><span>「Strange Love」- EABS, Jaubi</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>季洋 / 赵老师</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqXClrOpqttDudBW3dBVc1Ce3x-z.m4a" length="145136003" type="audio/mp4"/>
