    <guid isPermaLink="false">653d22ee21aad987541a94e4</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 28 Oct 2023 15:04:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见！眼看我们这个月更节目要变成一期一会了，那怎么行！</span></p><span></span><p><span>国庆期间赵老师出游伊朗，如此小众的目的地说啥也得聊聊见闻了，本期绝对值得收听！</span></p><span></span><p><span>* 因为我的 mic 戴反了声音有一些异常。下次注意，见谅！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>TIMELINE:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">05:05</a> - 国庆出游的目的地为啥选择了伊朗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a> - 去伊朗玩，主打一个安全</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1045">17:25</a> - 抵达伊朗，需要做哪些准备</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1159">19:19</a> - 神奇的伊朗 App Store 与互联网</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1397">23:17</a> - 在伊朗竖大拇指，点赞与骂人分不清楚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1490">24:50</a> - 关于女生要不要戴头巾的问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2255">37:35</a> - 伊朗的世俗化初探：男方也得买房买车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2470">41:10</a> - 伊朗年轻人的面貌大观：班儿逼，女性，普通话，现代化进程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2915">48:35</a> - 异国他乡听到崔健？伊朗民众的音乐癖好窥探</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3050">50:50</a> - 伊朗也有小粉红..or 粉绿？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3220">53:40</a> - 伊朗人得知哈马斯与以色列冲突时的反应</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3429">57:09</a> - 伊朗景点推荐 Top 1：前美国大使馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3640">01:00:40</a> - 伊朗青旅被动霸总，竟然偶遇汉服女孩？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4003">01:06:43</a> - 中国女孩在伊朗，头巾的戴与不戴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4252">01:10:52</a> - 坚定不移地走“不被定义的旅行”路线，坚决抵制“打卡攻略主义”旅游</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>PLAYLIST:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> - 《华尔兹》- 孤独的利里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5143">85:43</a> - 《一无所有》- 崔健</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>季洋 / 赵老师</span></p>]]></description>
